Generate a standalone C reproducer that triggers this vulnerability:

File: bfd/cofflink.c
Line: 2480
Function: _bfd_coff_final_link
Bug type: out-of-bounds-read
CWE: CWE-125
Explanation: Indexes obj_coff_sym_hashes(input_bfd) with irel->r_symndx without validating that r_symndx is within [0, obj_raw_syment_count(input_bfd)). A relocation entry with an invalid symbol index leads to reading beyond the obj_coff_sym_hashes array.

Source context:
```c
